                ja="ご依頼内容・希望時期・ご予算（未定可）"
                en="Scope / Timing / Budget, if known"
              />
            </p>
            <a class="phone-link" href="tel:+818034930723">
              <Text ja="電話（日本語）" en="Phone (Japanese)" />{' '}
              <span>080-3493-0723 ↗</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
